# Wave W17-I (Route 43): crater turf — grass thinning toward the crater lake, a sound green going rust-flecked as the climb rises, the wrongness in the ground before the water shows it (design: trees thinning into rust-red crater country — fixed story wrongness, not a season). Route 43’s own ground.
